    <div class="chapter reveal"><span class="bignum">03</span><div class="num">Chapter Three</div><div class="orn"><span class="d"></span></div><h2 id="first">The first stream to build</h2></div>
    <p class="answer reveal">The best first passive income stream is a single digital product — it's the fastest asset to build, the easiest to sell, and it teaches you the whole model in one cycle before you stack anything on top.</p>
    <p class="reveal">Don't start with five streams. Start with one, all the way through — made, listed, sold once. <strong>One completed stream teaches you more than five half-built ones, because only a finished one shows you what actually earns.</strong> The second stream is easy once the first has taught you the pattern.</p>

